{"title":"Career roadmap · Foreign Affairs Aspirant","role":"Foreign Affairs Aspirant","summary":"A Foreign Affairs professional works on international relations, diplomacy, foreign policy, geopolitical analysis, multilateral affairs, international development and cross-border cooperation. Since “Foreign Affairs Aspirant” is not a specific job title, this roadmap maps the degree toward careers such as diplomat, foreign-policy analyst, international-relations researcher, diplomatic officer and international programme specialist.","facts":{"Starts":"Year 1","Current degree":"BA (Bachelor of Arts – General / Honours)","Course":"International Studies / Diplomacy"},"about":[{"label":"Alignment","text":"Strong direct alignment"}],"intro":[{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"For India's diplomatic service, the principal route is the UPSC Civil Services Examination, followed by allocation/training according to the applicable service and government rules. Other foreign-affairs careers have different recruitment routes."}]}],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Typical route","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"flow","items":["BA International Studies","International Relations/Policy Internship","Research Assistant/Policy Associate","Foreign Affairs/International Relations Professional","Senior Analyst/Diplomatic Officer","Foreign Policy Specialist / Senior Diplomatic or International Affairs Role"]},{"type":"h","text":"Diplomatic-service route"},{"type":"flow","items":["BA","UPSC CSE preparation","Civil Services Examination","Service allocation","Foreign-service training","Diplomatic posting","Senior diplomatic responsibilities"]}]},{"heading":"Career horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Build international-relations knowledge, foreign-policy analysis, writing, languages and current-affairs awareness."}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Specialise in a region, strategic issue or policy domain and pursue international-affairs research or diplomatic-service pathways."}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Develop expertise in bilateral/multilateral relations, international security, trade, development or strategic affairs."}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Progress toward senior foreign-policy, diplomatic, international-development, strategic-analysis or international-organisation roles."}]]}]},{"heading":"What to build each year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["When","Build this","Learn from","Proof of progress","Gap it moves"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1 Sem 1"},{"text":"International-relations foundations"},{"text":"Political science, world history"},{"text":"Country/region briefs"},{"text":"Domain knowledge"}],[{"text":"Year 1 Sem 2"},{"text":"Geopolitical awareness"},{"text":"International politics, current affairs"},{"text":"Weekly geopolitical brief"},{"text":"Analytical thinking"}],[{"text":"Year 2 Sem 1"},{"text":"Foreign-policy analysis"},{"text":"Diplomacy, IR theory"},{"text":"Foreign-policy analysis"},{"text":"Research"}],[{"text":"Year 2 Sem 2"},{"text":"International economics"},{"text":"Trade, finance, development"},{"text":"Trade/economic-policy report"},{"text":"Quantitative thinking"}],[{"text":"Year 3 Sem 1"},{"text":"Strategic affairs"},{"text":"Security, geopolitics, regional studies"},{"text":"Strategic assessment"},{"text":"Strategic thinking"}],[{"text":"Year 3 Sem 2"},{"text":"Diplomatic/research internship"},{"text":"Think tank/foreign-affairs organisation"},{"text":"Internship + policy papers"},{"text":"Employability"}],[{"text":"Honours Year 4 Sem 1"},{"text":"Regional specialisation"},{"text":"Advanced IR + language"},{"text":"Country dossier"},{"text":"Specialisation"}],[{"text":"Honours Year 4 Sem 2"},{"text":"Career launch"},{"text":"Dissertation + exam/internship preparation"},{"text":"Policy portfolio + dissertation"},{"text":"Professional readiness"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Core subjects to prioritise"},{"ty