"},{"text":"Policy analysis"},{"text":"Risk assessment"},{"text":"Scenario planning"},{"text":"Geopolitical analysis"},{"text":"Data interpretation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Digital"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"PowerPoint"},{"text":"Data visualisation"},{"text":"GIS basics"},{"text":"OSINT research"},{"text":"Statistical analysis"},{"text":"Citation/reference management"},{"text":"AI-assisted research with rigorous source verification"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Languages"},{"type":"p","text":"English should be exceptionally strong. Add at least one foreign language relevant to your regional interests."},{"type":"p","text":"Examples:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"French"},{"text":"Arabic"},{"text":"Mandarin Chinese"},{"text":"Spanish"},{"text":"Russian"},{"text":"German"},{"text":"Japanese"},{"text":"Korean"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Portfolio target"},{"type":"p","text":"By graduation, build:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"20 country briefs"},{"text":"10 foreign-policy analyses"},{"text":"10 geopolitical risk briefs"},{"text":"Indian foreign-policy timeline"},{"text":"India–major-country relationship analysis"},{"text":"UN policy paper"},{"text":"International trade analysis"},{"text":"Regional-security assessment"},{"text":"Diplomatic negotiation simulation"},{"text":"International-law case analysis"},{"text":"International organisation profile series"},{"text":"Foreign-language proficiency"},{"text":"International-development project"},{"text":"Dissertation"},{"text":"At least one think-tank/international-affairs internship"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Flagship portfolio project"},{"type":"p","text":"Build a Foreign Policy Intelligence Portfolio containing:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Country dossier","Political system","Economy","Security environment","India relationship","Strategic interests","Trade","Major risks","International organisations","Future scenarios","Policy recommendations"]},{"type":"p","text":"This provides strong evidence for po